# Pinball: an open floor studded with low crates and a few columns in a
# diamond lattice. Every shot comes back at someone.
#
#   #  wall (wall_height)   =  crate (crate_height)   O  pillar
#   P  player start         E  enemy spawn            .  floor
# One character is `tile` metres; the '#' border is the outer wall.

name          Pinball
tile          2
wall_height   2.6
crate_height  0.8
pillar_height 5

map
###########################
